# Upstream (Arch) package names whose Package_Map outcome for the suite
# becomes a Depends of motanka-core. packaging/build.sh resolves them with
# tools/pkgmap from packages.yaml and writes them in place of the line
# @PKGMAP_DEPENDS@ in debian/control. Each must have an apt or motanka
# outcome on every suite.
#
# Only what Upstream's session needs to start belongs here: the commands
# its Hyprland autostart and the shell launcher call before any menu is
# used, and the font its bar draws its text and icons with. Everything
# else in Upstream's package lists is installed through the Helper at
# first use, or later by a separate metapackage.
fontconfig
jq
socat
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic
